{{<shell}}{{$content}}
<p class="crumb"><a href="{{calendarUrl}}">&larr; Events</a></p>
<h1>Suggested</h1>
<p class="hint">What members have put forward, oldest first &mdash; a queue people are waiting in is
  answered in the order they joined it. Accepting one publishes it; declining keeps it, with the
  reason, so the person who suggested it can see what happened.</p>
{{^suggestionsOn}}<p class="problem">Suggestions are switched off for this community, so nothing
  new will arrive here. Turn them on with <code>calendar.suggestions</code>.</p>{{/suggestionsOn}}
<div class="panel" data-panel="{{panelUrl}}">{{{panel}}}</div>
{{/content}}{{/shell}}
